layout.work_new.import_help_html = Typst: everything before the first heading becomes the work template, <code>=</code>/<code>==</code>/<code>===</code> the outline. Markdown: <code>#</code>/<code>##</code>/<code>###</code> become the outline (deeper levels limited to the third); what cannot be mapped is in the report. A ZIP or folder brings exactly one main file (.typ or .md, otherwise <code>index.md</code>/<code>main.typ</code>) and the images relative to it. If the title exists already, please enter another one.
